  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a Better Tomorrow - Coffee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the BBT-Coffee is to achieve structural transformation and enhance the resilience and adaptive capacity of Tanzania&#xbf;s coffee sector by facilitating climate-smart technologies and infrastructure, access to climate finance and institutional support.

During a 12 years multiphase adaptive programme, the BBT-Coffee aims to directly reach approximately 89,000 smallholder coffee farmers, contributing to national efforts for sustainable rural development, poverty reduction, and low-carbon agricultural transformation.</narrative>
  </description>
